<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK FEB PPI UP 0.6 PCT MO/MO, +5.3 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK FEB PPI UP 0.6 PCT MO/MO, +5.3 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak producer prices rose 0.6 percent month-on-month in February 1997, taking the year-on-year increase to 5.3 percent, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The SUSR did not provide comparison figures for February 1996, saying it begun calculating PPI according to European Union standards from the beginning of this year.</p>
